  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "从一枚六角格开始扩张布局，每次击打赚取代币，再在商店购买升级。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Start with a single hex tile and carefully expand your setup. Each strike earns tokens, which can be spent in the shop to unlock upgrades and enhance your strategy.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2408870/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "冰淇淋、玉米热狗、调味料、锤子与马戏格子层层叠乘，六角格位置决定最终得分协同。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Boost your tokens with tasty treats like Ice Cream and Corn Dogs, then supercharge them with Condiments. Upgrade your Strikers with stronger Hammers to multiply rewards even further. Introduce new hex tiles such as Juggling Clowns and One-Man bands to stack multipliers and create powerful combos. Positioning of the various hex tiles is important, with synergies to be discovered and used to your advantage in maximizing your score.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2408870/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
